  "details": "<p>In the <em>Barrington Atlas Directory</em>, Borza puts Antigoneia at \"<span>Tremnik?\". DARE puts it (without comment) at Negotino, 7km to the northwest. Online assertions can be noted that also place Antigoneia at Negotino, but again without supporting evidence.</span></p>",
